os Tava perfektā smaida rekonstrukcijas plānu.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">02</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Smaida rehabilitācija tiek veikta tā, lai smaids atbilstu Taviem sejas vaibstiem un uzlabotu Tavu kopējo vizuālo tēlu.</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Digitālā smaida dizaina izveide uzreiz ļauj ieraudzīt savu nākotnes smaidu, pirms tiek veiktas jebkādas manipulācijas.</div></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[--><div class="service-benefits u-bg-primary complex-diagnostics-page__benefits"><div class="wheel-block"><div class="wheel-block__sticky-content"><div class="wheel-block__header"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Tavs smaids sākas šeit<!--]--></h2><!--]--></div></div><div class="wheel-block__body"><div class="wheel-block__body-inner"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="wheel-block-wheel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1202" height="1202" viewBox="0 0 1202 1202" fill="none" class="wheel-block-wheel__svg" style="--wheel-rotation-degrees-start:72deg;"><circle cx="600" cy="600" r="534.5" stroke="#DDEFDE" opacity=".2"></circle><!--[--><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(0 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">1</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(72 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r=